   "q_en": "<p>Train A of length 800 meters crosses another train B of length 1200 meters, running on a parallel track in the opposite direction in 25 seconds. If train B cross a pole in 1 minute 20 seconds, then what is the speed of train A?</p>",
   "q_hi": "<p>800 &#2350;&#2368;&#2335;&#2352; &#2354;&#2350;&#2381;&#2348;&#2368; &#2335;&#2381;&#2352;&#2375;&#2344; A, &#2357;&#2367;&#2346;&#2352;&#2368;&#2340; &#2342;&#2367;&#2358;&#2366; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2350;&#2366;&#2344;&#2366;&#2306;&#2340;&#2352; &#2335;&#2381;&#2352;&#2376;&#2325; &#2346;&#2352; &#2330;&#2354; &#2352;&#2361;&#2368; 1200 &#2350;&#2368;&#2335;&#2352; &#2354;&#2350;&#2381;&#2348;&#2368; &#2342;&#2370;&#2360;&#2352;&#2368; &#2335;&#2381;&#2352;&#2375;&#2344; B &#2325;&#2379; 25 &#2360;&#2375;&#2325;&#2306;&#2337; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2346;&#2366;&#2352; &#2325;&#2352;&#2340;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2351;&#2342;&#2367; &#2335;&#2381;&#2352;&#2375;&#2344; B &#2319;&#2325; &#2326;&#2306;&#2349;&#2375; &#2325;&#2379; 1 &#2350;&#2367;&#2344;&#2335; 20 &#2360;&#2375;&#2325;&#2306;&#2337; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2346;&#2366;&#2352; &#2325;&#2352;&#2340;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; &#2335;&#2381;&#2352;&#2375;&#2344; A &#2325;&#2368; &#2327;&#2340;&#2367; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?</p>",
   "options_en": [
    "45 m/s",
    "65 m/s",
    "35 m/s",
    "40 m/s"
   ],
   "options_hi": [
    "45 &#2350;&#2368;&#2335;&#2352;/&#2360;&#2375;&#2325;&#2375;&#2306;&#2337;",
    "65 &#2350;&#2368;/&#2360;&#2375;",
    "35 &#2350;&#2368;/&#2360;&#2375;",
    "40 &#2350;&#2368;&#2335;&#2352;/&#2360;&#2375;&#2325;&#2375;&#2306;&#2337;"
