   "solution_en": "<p>Speed of train B = 1200/80 = 15</p><p>Let speed of train A = a m/s</p><p>According to the question,</p><p>(1200 + 800)/(a + 15) = 25</p><p>=&gt; a + 15 = 2000/25</p><p>=&gt; a = 80  -  15 = 65 m/s</p>",
