   "q_en": "<p>A train crosses a pole and platform in 17 seconds and 42 seconds respectively. If the length of the platform is 200m then what is the length of the train?</p>",
   "q_hi": "<p>&#2319;&#2325; &#2352;&#2375;&#2354;&#2327;&#2366;&#2337;&#2364;&#2368; &#2319;&#2325; &#2326;&#2306;&#2349;&#2375; &#2324;&#2352; &#2346;&#2381;&#2354;&#2375;&#2335;&#2347;&#2366;&#2352;&#2381;&#2350; &#2325;&#2379; &#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2350;&#2358;&#2307; 17 &#2360;&#2375;&#2325;&#2306;&#2337; &#2324;&#2352; 42 &#2360;&#2375;&#2325;&#2306;&#2337; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2346;&#2366;&#2352; &#2325;&#2352;&#2340;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2351;&#2342;&#2367; &#2346;&#2381;&#2354;&#2375;&#2335;&#2347;&#2366;&#2352;&#2381;&#2350; &#2325;&#2368; &#2354;&#2306;&#2348;&#2366;&#2312; 200 &#2350;&#2368;&#2335;&#2352; &#2361;&#2376; &#2340;&#2379; &#2352;&#2375;&#2354;&#2327;&#2366;&#2337;&#2364;&#2368; &#2325;&#2368; &#2354;&#2306;&#2348;&#2366;&#2312; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?</p>",
