   "solution_en": "<p>Let the length and speed of the train be p meters and v m/s respectively.</p><p>Since the trains crosses a pole in 17 seconds</p><p>p = 17v ------ (1)</p><p>The train crosses a platform in 42 seconds</p><p>200 + p = 42v -------- (2)</p><p>On solving equation (1) and (2) we get-</p><p>v = 200/25 = 8 m/sec </p><p>p = 17  X  8 = 136 m</p><p>Therefore, the length of the train = 136 m</p>",
