   "q_en": "<p>Two trains, P and Q start from stations A and B towards each other. P and Q take 5 hours 20 minutes and 8 hours 20 minutes to reach B and A respectively after they meet. If train P is moving at 55 km/hr, then find the speed of train Q. </p>",
   "q_hi": "<p>&#2342;&#2379; &#2352;&#2375;&#2354;&#2327;&#2366;&#2337;&#2364;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366;&#2305;, P &#2324;&#2352; Q, &#2360;&#2381;&#2335;&#2375;&#2358;&#2344; A &#2324;&#2352; B &#2360;&#2375; &#2319;&#2325; &#2342;&#2370;&#2360;&#2352;&#2375; &#2325;&#2368; &#2323;&#2352; &#2330;&#2354;&#2340;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;&#2404; P &#2324;&#2352; Q &#2325;&#2379; &#2350;&#2367;&#2354;&#2344;&#2375; &#2325;&#2375; &#2348;&#2366;&#2342; &#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2350;&#2358;&#2307; B &#2324;&#2352; A &#2340;&#2325; &#2346;&#2361;&#2369;&#2305;&#2330;&#2344;&#2375; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; 5 &#2328;&#2306;&#2335;&#2375; 20 &#2350;&#2367;&#2344;&#2335; &#2324;&#2352; 8 &#2328;&#2306;&#2335;&#2375; 20 &#2350;&#2367;&#2344;&#2335; &#2354;&#2327;&#2340;&#2375; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;&#2404; &#2351;&#2342;&#2367; &#2352;&#2375;&#2354;&#2327;&#2366;&#2337;&#2364;&#2368; P 55 &#2325;&#2367;&#2350;&#2368;/&#2328;&#2306;&#2335;&#2366; &#2325;&#2368; &#2327;&#2340;&#2367; &#2360;&#2375; &#2330;&#2354; &#2352;&#2361;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; &#2352;&#2375;&#2354;&#2327;&#2366;&#2337;&#2364;&#2368; Q &#2325;&#2368; &#2327;&#2340;&#2367; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p>",
   "options_en": [
    "60 km/h",
    "72 km/h",
    "58 km/h",
    "44 km/h"
   ],
   "options_hi": [
    "60 &#2325;&#2367;&#2350;&#2368;/&#2328;&#2306;&#2335;&#2366;",
    "72 &#2325;&#2367;&#2350;&#2368;/&#2328;&#2306;&#2335;&#2366;",
    "58 &#2325;&#2367;&#2350;&#2368;/&#2328;&#2306;&#2335;&#2366;",
    "44 &#2325;&#2367;&#2350;&#2368;/&#2328;&#2306;&#2335;&#2366;"
   ],
   "answer": 3,
   "solution_en": "<p>Time of P = 5 hours 20 minutes = 16/3 hours</p><p>Time of Q = 8 hour 20 minutes = 25/3 hours</p><p>Speed of P/Speed of Q = &radic;(Time of Q/ Time of P) </p><p>55/ Speed of Q = &radic;[(25/3)/(16/3)]</p><p>55/ Speed of Q = 5/4</p><p>Speed of Q = 55 * 4/ 5 = 44 km/hr</p>",
   "solution_hi": "<p>Time of P = 5 hours 20 minutes = 16/3 hours</p><p>Time of Q = 8 hour 20 minutes = 25/3 hours</p><p>Speed of P/Speed of Q = &radic;(Time of Q/ Time of P) </p><p>55/ Speed of Q = &radic;[(25/3)/(16/3)]</p><p>55/ Speed of Q = 5/4</p><p>Speed of Q = 55 * 4/ 5 = 44 km/hr</p>",
