   "q_en": "<p>A train 1920 meter long crosses a tunnel whose length is 1880 meters in 76 seconds. If a truck is running at a speed of 65 m/s towards the train and train is 575 meter away from the truck, then in how much time (in seconds) will the train meets the truck?</p>",
   "q_hi": "<p>1920 &#2350;&#2368;&#2335;&#2352; (m) &#2354;&#2306;&#2348;&#2368; &#2319;&#2325; &#2335;&#2381;&#2352;&#2375;&#2344; 1880 &#2350;&#2368;&#2335;&#2352; &#2354;&#2306;&#2348;&#2368; &#2319;&#2325; &#2360;&#2369;&#2352;&#2306;&#2327; &#2325;&#2379; 76 &#2360;&#2375;&#2325;&#2306;&#2337; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2346;&#2366;&#2352; &#2325;&#2352;&#2340;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2351;&#2342;&#2367; &#2319;&#2325; &#2335;&#2381;&#2352;&#2325;, &#2335;&#2381;&#2352;&#2375;&#2344; &#2325;&#2368; &#2323;&#2352; 65 m/s &#2325;&#2368; &#2330;&#2366;&#2354; &#2360;&#2375; &#2351;&#2366;&#2340;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366; &#2325;&#2352; &#2352;&#2361;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376; &#2324;&#2352; &#2335;&#2381;&#2352;&#2375;&#2344;, &#2335;&#2381;&#2352;&#2325; &#2360;&#2375; 575 &#2350;&#2368;&#2335;&#2352; &#2325;&#2368; &#2342;&#2370;&#2352;&#2368; &#2346;&#2352; &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; &#2335;&#2381;&#2352;&#2375;&#2344; &#2325;&#2367;&#2340;&#2344;&#2375; &#2360;&#2350;&#2351; (&#2360;&#2375;&#2325;&#2306;&#2337;) &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2335;&#2381;&#2352;&#2325; &#2360;&#2375; &#2350;&#2367;&#2354;&#2375;&#2327;&#2368;?</p>",
   "options_en": [
    "6",
    "5",
    "7",
    "4"
   ],
   "options_hi": [
    "6",
