    "7",
    "4"
   ],
   "answer": 1,
   "solution_en": "<p>The train can cover (1920 + 1880) = 3800 m distance in 76 seconds which means the speed of the train = 3800/76 = 50 m/s</p><p>Relative speed of truck and train = 50 + 65 = 115 m/s</p><p>To cover the distance of 575 meters, it will take = 575/115 = 5 seconds</p>",
   "solution_hi": "<p>The train can cover (1920 + 1880) = 3800 m distance in 76 seconds which means the speed of the train = 3800/76 = 50 m/s</p><p>Relative speed of truck and train = 50 + 65 = 115 m/s</p><p>To cover the distance of 575 meters, it will take = 575/115 = 5 seconds</p>",
